      "assessment": "JCM525 dissolves the mineral and yeast ingredients in 500 mL water, adjusts acidity and sterilizes the basal material separately from a second 500 mL mineral suspension. OTHER describes this nutrient basal preparation; neither low yeast mass nor high mineral content establishes a concentrated mineral-stock identity. Chalcopyrite/alternative mineral suspension remains excluded, and no unchanged molecular sulfuric-acid constituent is inferred from pH adjustment.",
